{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  PRESS SLIDER SECTION
  =============================================================================
  Interactive press/media coverage display section with accordion functionality
  - Uses HTML details/summary elements for native accordion behavior
  - Displays press logos/images with expandable text content
  - Customizable background colors and wave divider options
  - JavaScript-enhanced interaction for single-open accordion behavior
  - Responsive design with lazy-loaded images
  - Supports multiple press/media coverage items
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  DYNAMIC BACKGROUND COLOR STYLING
  =============================================================================
  Optional custom background color from theme editor settings
  - section.settings.color_bg: Custom background color setting
  - shopify-section-{{ section.id }}: Unique section identifier for styling
  - background-color: CSS property for custom background
  - Only applies when color_bg setting is not blank
  - Allows merchants to customize section appearance
{% endcomment %}
{%- unless section.settings.color_bg == blank -%}
  {%- style -%}
     #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
        background-color: {{ section.settings.color_bg }};
     }
   {%- endstyle -%}
{%- endunless -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  WAVE DIVIDER INTEGRATION
  =============================================================================
  Optional decorative wave borders for visual interest
  - wave: Wave position setting (none/top/bottom/both)
  - wave-styles: Snippet for rendering wave SVG elements
  - wave_position: Passes wave position to wave-styles snippet
  - section_id: Unique section identifier for styling
  - fill_color: Wave color matches section background color
  - Creates seamless integration between waves and background
  - Only renders when wave setting is not "none"
{% endcomment %}
{%- if section.settings.wave != "none" -%}
  {%- render 'wave-styles', 
              wave_position: section.settings.wave, 
              section_id: section.id
              fill_color: section.settings.color_bg -%}
{%- endif -%}

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  MAIN PRESS SLIDER CONTAINER
  =============================================================================
  Primary container with section identification and styling
  - section-id-{{ section.id }}: Unique identifier for section-specific styling
  - press-slider: Base styling class for press slider functionality
  - Contains all press/media coverage items as accordion elements
{% endcomment %}
<div class="section-id-{{ section.id }} press-slider">
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    PRESS BLOCKS ITERATION
    =============================================================================
    Loops through all press blocks assigned to this section
    - section.blocks: Array of all blocks assigned to this section
    - block: Individual press block object with type and settings
    - Each block represents one press/media coverage item
    - Creates accordion-style expandable content for each item
  {% endcomment %}
  {% for block in section.blocks %}
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    PRESS SLIDE ACCORDION ITEM
    =============================================================================
    Individual press item using HTML details/summary for accordion behavior
    - press-slide: Base styling class for individual press items
    - details: HTML element for expandable content functionality
    - open: Attribute for first item to be expanded by default
    - forloop.first: Liquid variable to identify first iteration
    - Provides native accordion behavior without JavaScript dependency
  {% endcomment %}
  <details class="press-slide"{% if forloop.first %} open{% endif %}>
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      PRESS ITEM SUMMARY/HEADER
      =============================================================================
      Clickable header with press logo/image and interaction trigger
      - summary: HTML element for accordion header functionality
      - data-show-quote: Custom data attribute for JavaScript interaction
      - Contains press logo/image and serves as clickable trigger
      - Expands/collapses associated content when clicked
    {% endcomment %}
    <summary data-show-quote>
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        PRESS LOGO/IMAGE DISPLAY
        =============================================================================
        Press logo or image with responsive sizing and optimization
        - block.settings.image: Image from theme editor settings
        - image_url filter: Generates optimized image URL
        - width: 240: Fixed width for consistent layout
        - alt: Image alt text for accessibility
        - loading="lazy": Lazy loading for performance optimization
        - press-img: CSS class for press image styling
      {% endcomment %}
      <img src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 240 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
          loading="lazy"
          class="press-img" />
    </summary>
    
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      PRESS CONTENT TEXT
      =============================================================================
      Expandable text content for press/media coverage details
      - press-text: CSS class for text content styling
      - block.settings.text: Rich text content from theme editor
      - Displays when accordion item is expanded
      - Contains press coverage details, quotes, or descriptions
    {% endcomment %}
    <span class="press-text">{{ block.settings.text }}</span>
  </details>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  ACCORDION INTERACTION JAVASCRIPT
  =============================================================================
  JavaScript for enhanced accordion behavior and single-open functionality
  - window.addEventListener: Global click event listener
  - data-show-quote: Custom data attribute selector for interaction
  - Single-open behavior: Closes other open items when one is clicked
  - removeAttribute('open'): Closes accordion items programmatically
  - Enhances native HTML details/summary behavior
{% endcomment %}
<script>
  {% comment %}
    =============================================================================
    GLOBAL CLICK EVENT HANDLER
    =============================================================================
    Listens for clicks on press slide elements
    - window.addEventListener: Global event listener for all clicks
    - function(e): Event handler function with event object
    - element: Target element that was clicked
    - Checks if clicked element has showQuote data attribute
  {% endcomment %}
  window.addEventListener('click', function(e){
    const element = e.target;
    {% comment %}
      =============================================================================
      PRESS SLIDE INTERACTION DETECTION
      =============================================================================
      Identifies clicks on press slide summary elements
      - 'showQuote' in element.dataset: Checks for custom data attribute
      - element.parentElement.parentElement: Navigates to press-slide container
      - querySelectorAll('.press-slide'): Finds all press slide elements
      - Enables single-open accordion behavior
    {% endcomment %}
    if ('showQuote' in element.dataset) {
      {% comment %}
        =============================================================================
        SINGLE-OPEN ACCORDION LOGIC
        =============================================================================
        Closes all other open accordion items
        - forEach: Iterates through all press slide elements
        - slide != element: Excludes the clicked item from closing
        - removeAttribute('open'): Closes accordion items
        - Ensures only one press item is open at a time
      {% endcomment %}
      element.parentElement.parentElement.querySelectorAll('.press-slide').forEach(slide => {
        if (slide != element) {
          slide.removeAttribute('open');
        }
      })
    }
  });
</script>

{% comment %}
  =============================================================================
  SCHEMA CONFIGURATION SUMMARY
  =============================================================================
  Theme editor configuration for the press slider section
  
  **SECTION OVERVIEW:**
  Interactive press/media coverage display section using HTML accordion elements.
  Displays press logos with expandable text content and customizable styling options.
  
  **KEY FEATURES:**
  - Native HTML accordion functionality (details/summary)
  - Single-open accordion behavior with JavaScript enhancement
  - Customizable background colors and wave dividers
  - Lazy-loaded press logos/images
  - Responsive design with optimized image sizing
  
  **SECTION SETTINGS:**
  - wave: Wave divider options (none/top/bottom/both, default: none)
  - color_bg: Custom background color (default: #ffffff)
  
  **BLOCK SETTINGS (per press item):**
  - text: Rich text content for press coverage details
  - image: Press logo or media image (240px width recommended)
  - link: Optional URL for press item (currently unused in template)
  - collection: Optional collection reference (currently unused in template)
  
  **INTERACTION BEHAVIOR:**
  - First press item opens by default
  - Click to expand/collapse individual items
  - Single-open behavior: Only one item open at a time
  - Native HTML accordion with JavaScript enhancement
  
  **ACCESSIBILITY FEATURES:**
  - Semantic HTML structure with details/summary
  - Alt text support for press images
  - Keyboard accessible accordion functionality
  - Screen reader friendly content structure
  
  **PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS:**
  - Lazy loading for press images
  - Optimized image sizing (240px width)
  - Efficient JavaScript event handling
  - Minimal DOM manipulation
{% endcomment %}
{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Press Slideshow",
  "class": "press-slideshow-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "wave",
      "label": "Wave",
      "options": [
        {
          "value": "none",
          "label": "None"
        },
        {
          "value": "top",
          "label": "Top"
        },
        {
          "value": "bottom",
          "label": "Bottom"
        },
        {
          "value": "both",
          "label": "Both"
        }
      ],
      "default": "none"
    },
    {
      "id": "color_bg",
      "type": "color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#ffffff"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "name": "Press",
      "settings": [
        {
          "id": "text",
          "type": "richtext",
          "label": "Text"
        },
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Image"
        },
        {
          "id": "link",
          "type": "url",
          "label": "url"
        },
        {
          "id": "collection",
          "type": "collection",
          "label": "Collection",
          "info": "Select a collection this quote should be limited to. Otherwise, it shows for all products/collections"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Press Slideshow",
      "category": "Press"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}